      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling super drained lately like just constant fatigue even after sleeping. i think my iron is low cuz i saw some stuff online about biohacking levels for more energy. what's a good aggressive daily dose of iron i should take to get my levels up fast? i dont really want to wait weeks for bloodwork results if i can just jumpstart it now",
