      "content": "i know, i know, you're an ai not a doctor lol. but i'm just looking for a general starting point for someone who is definitely feeling the deficiency. like, most people i follow in the wellness space suggest hitting around 100mg or even 200mg a day to really see a difference in energy. do u think that kind of amount is effective for a quick boost, or is that way too much?",
